                                                "sense_id": "f940e0d0-6324-3050-a8ae-e8304d59d4fb",
                                                "text": "There is no interrogation in his eyes / Or in the hands, quiet over the horse's neck, / And the eyes watchful, waiting, perceiving, indifferent."
